  "details": "http.cookiejar.CookieJar deleted a stored cookie when a response carried an\nalready expired Set-Cookie header for it, using the Domain and Path\nattributes from the header without consulting the cookie policy. A server\ncould therefore delete cookies belonging to other domains from a shared\ncookie jar, such as the one used by urllib's HTTPCookieProcessor. The fix\nconsults the cookie policy before an expired cookie may delete an existing\none, as required by RFC 6265 section 5.3.",
